<title>EGYPT: Rakta end-Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Rakta end-Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of the financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1:</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds):</p>
<p>Net sales			    96,132,398     (146,945,544)</p>
<p>Production costs		   86,491,669	(94,967,012)</p>
<p>Overheads			     2,711,813	 (9,989,871)</p>
<p>Exceptional revenue		 2,403,565	 (5,568,774)</p>
<p>Exceptional expenses		  336,151	 (1,409,638)</p>
<p>Net profit before tax	     8,996,330	(46,147,797)</p>
<p>(Full company name is Rakta/General Paper Industry )</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
